<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR"<% if (locals.theme) { %> data-theme="<%= theme %>"<% } %>>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title><%= title %></title>
    <meta name="description" content="<%= description %>">
    <link rel="canonical" href="<%= canonical %>">
    <meta name="robots" content="<%= robots %>">
    <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/favicon-32x32.png">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Sora:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <%- include('_tracking') %>
    <style>
        :root {
            --ink: #101318;
            --muted: #6b7380;
            --paper: #f5f6f8;
            --solar: #e35a1b;
            --wa: #25d366;
            --font-h: "Sora", system-ui, sans-serif;
            --font-b: "Manrope", system-ui, sans-serif;
        }
        *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            margin: 0; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
            font-family: var(--font-b); color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper);
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .wrap { width: min(640px, calc(100% - 2rem)); margin-inline: auto; }
        .topbar {
            background: #101318; padding: 0.9rem 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
        }
        .topbar-inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; max-width: 1120px; width: calc(100% - 2rem); margin: 0 auto; }
        .topbar-logo { height: 28px; width: auto; }
        .btn {
            display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem;
            text-decoration: none; border: none; cursor: pointer;
            font-family: var(--font-b); font-weight: 800; border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 0.9rem 1.2rem;
        }
        .btn-sm { padding: 0.6rem 0.95rem; font-size: 0.85rem; }
        .btn-solar { background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f06a2b, var(--solar)); color: #fff; }
        .btn-wa { background: var(--wa); color: #083218; }
        .btn-ghost {
            background: transparent; color: var(--ink);
            border: 1.5px solid #d5d9e0;
        }
        main {
            flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 3.5rem 0;
            background:
                linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(245,246,248,0.92), rgba(245,246,248,0.97)),
                url("/img/lp/solar-industrial-hero.jpg") center/cover no-repeat;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
            box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(16,19,24,0.12); text-align: center;
        }
        .check {
            width: 56px; height: 56px; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 auto 1.25rem;
            display: grid; place-items: center;
            background: #e8f8ef; color: #0f7a4a; font-size: 1.4rem;
        }
        h1 {
            font-family: var(--font-h); font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2rem);
            margin: 0 0 0.75rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.15;
        }
        .lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 1.75rem; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.55; }
        .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.65rem; justify-content: center; }
        .steps {
            text-align: left; margin-top: 1.75rem; display: grid; gap: 0.65rem;
        }
        .step {
            background: #f7f8fa; border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
            font-size: 0.92rem; color: #3a4250;
        }
        .step strong {
            display: block; color: var(--solar); font-size: 0.72rem;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }
        footer {
            padding: 1.25rem 0; text-align: center; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted);
        }
        footer a { color: #3a4250; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('_tracking-body') %>
<header class="topbar">
    <div class="topbar-inner">
        <a href="/" aria-label="Klyfe Electric">
            <img class="topbar-logo" src="/img/Assinatura%20Completa%20-%20AmareloB%20-%20Klyfe.webp" alt="Klyfe Electric" width="160" height="28">
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-wa btn-sm" href="<%= waUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-content-category="solar">
            <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> WhatsApp
        </a>
    </div>
</header>

<main>
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="check" aria-hidden="true"><i class="fas fa-check"></i></div>
            <h1>Pedido recebido. Em até 24h o estudo começa.</h1>
            <p class="lead">
                Nossa equipe vai analisar o perfil de consumo e demanda da sua empresa.
                Para agilizar, envie a fatura de energia no WhatsApp agora.
            </p>
            <div class="actions">
                <a class="btn btn-wa" href="<%= waUrl %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener" data-content-category="solar">
                    <i class="fab fa-whatsapp"></i> Enviar fatura no WhatsApp
                </a>
                <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/lp/energia-solar-empresas">Voltar</a>
            </div>
            <div class="steps">
                <div class="step"><strong>Agora</strong> Confirmamos o recebimento e priorizamos o retorno técnico.</div>
                <div class="step"><strong>Até 24h</strong> Você recebe a primeira leitura de ROI / payback / demanda.</div>
                <div class="step"><strong>Depois</strong> Se fizer sentido, avançamos para o projeto com ART e homologação.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<footer>
    Klyfe Electric · <a href="/">Site completo</a>
</footer>
<%- include('../partials/cookie-banner') %>
</body>
</html>
